Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: zyphoros-artwork
Architecture: all
Depends: desktop-base, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Zyphor OS artwork: wallpaper, login and boot menu backgrounds
 A desktop-base theme, made the active one (the "desktop-theme" alternative,
 above Debian's own themes). Everything that follows desktop-base's active
 theme shows it: the desktop wallpaper of Xfce, GNOME and KDE Plasma, the
 lock screen, the LightDM and SDDM login screens and the GRUB menu of
 installed systems. Also the Zyphor OS logo icon (zyphoros-logo).
